<title>POLAND: Polish housing output rises 4.1 pct m/m in August.</title>
<headline>Polish housing output rises 4.1 pct m/m in August.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of flats completed in August rose 4.1 percent from July but was 15.5 percent lower than in August 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 3,658 flats were completed in August bringing the total for the January-August period to 28,644 flats, against some 35,280 flats built in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	  AUGUST     JULY	 AUGUST 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	  4.1	 -25.6	   N.A.</p>
<p> number of flats built	  3,658	3,513	  4,329</p>
